---
---

<section id="pricing" class="py-24 md:py-[120px]" style="background: #ECE4B8;">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-6">

    <p class="font-mono text-xs mb-10 tracking-wider" style="color: #575280;">// first_engagement</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-6 mb-6">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl text-navy leading-tight tracking-tight max-w-xl">
        One low-risk way in.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted md:text-right shrink-0 max-w-xs">
        Start with a Sprint — a fixed, two-week piece of real work. We decide together what comes after.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-16 h-px" style="background: #d8d0a8;"></div>

    <!-- The Sprint — single, framed card -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr] gap-px rounded overflow-hidden" style="background: #d8d0a8;">

      <!-- Left: the offer -->
      <div class="bg-navy text-cream p-10 md:p-12 flex flex-col">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs mb-6" style="color: #a09cbe;">// the_sprint</p>

        <div class="mb-8 flex items-baseline gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="font-serif text-6xl md:text-7xl text-cream">€6,250</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs" style="color: #a09cbe;">two weeks · one real outcome</span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md" style="color: #d8d2ee;">
          A scoped, fixed-price engagement. You leave with working software or a tested prototype plus a buildable plan. No commitment beyond it.
        </p>

        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 mb-10 flex-1">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: #a09cbe;">
            <span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-0.5">→</span>
            Day 0 meet-and-greet — Day 1 starts as real work
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: #a09cbe;">
            <span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-0.5">→</span>
            Week 1: map, prototype, test with five real users
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: #a09cbe;">
            <span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-0.5">→</span>
            Week 2: build one feature live, or prove the plan
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: #a09cbe;">
            <span class="text-coral shrink-0 mt-0.5">→</span>
            Senior team, in your Slack — no juniors, no handoffs
          </li>
        </ul>

        <a href="/sprint"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-sm bg-coral text-cream text-sm font-medium hover:bg-coral-deep transition-colors self-start">
          Book a Sprint →
        </a>

        <p class="font-mono text-xs mt-6" style="color: #575280;">
          // Full credit toward month 1 if you continue within 14 days.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: what comes after -->
      <div class="bg-cream p-10 md:p-12 flex flex-col">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs mb-6" style="color: #b8b2d8;">// after_the_sprint</p>

        <p class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-navy leading-snug mb-6">
          Tailored to your product, scoped with you.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          If it's working, we move into an ongoing arrangement — sized to your product and your pace. We'll price it with you directly, once we both know what we're building.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          No lock-in theatre. We earn the next sprint by being worth it — not by trapping you in a contract.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-auto font-serif text-lg text-navy leading-snug border-t pt-6" style="border-color: #d8d0a8;">
          Same team, for years.<br/>
          <span class="text-navy-muted">Continuity is the product.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
